  "description": "A modular monolith for ASP.NET Core with no framework: one base class over IHostingStartup and IStartupFilter, plus analyzers that keep the architecture from leaking. Modules are ordinary class libraries activated by the HOSTINGSTARTUPASSEMBLIES environment variable, so deployment topology becomes configuration rather than a rebuild.",
